{"issue": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1786", "repository_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK", "labels_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1786/labels{/name}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1786/comments", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1786/events", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1786", "id": 1243975585, "node_id": "I_kwDOBabE0s5KJY-h", "number": 1786, "title": "Errors while using mavsdk::Geofence reference", "user": {"login": "aaronj0", "id": 75925957, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjc1OTI1OTU3", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75925957?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/aaronj0", "html_url": "https://github.com/aaronj0", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/aaronj0/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/aaronj0/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/aaronj0/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/aaronj0/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/aaronj0/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/aaronj0/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/aaronj0/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/aaronj0/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/aaronj0/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "labels": [], "state": "closed", "locked": false, "assignees": [], "milestone": null, "comments": 5, "created_at": "2022-05-21T13:20:28Z", "updated_at": "2022-08-14T03:00:28Z", "closed_at": "2022-08-14T03:00:28Z", "assignee": null, "author_association": "NONE", "issue_field_values": [], "type": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "sub_issues_summary": {"total": 0, "completed": 0, "percent_completed": 0}, "issue_dependencies_summary": {"blocked_by": 0, "total_blocked_by": 0, "blocking": 0, "total_blocking": 0}, "body": "I am trying to upload a geofence in my mavsdk script. Im getting errors while building. i suspect it has something to do with the constructor itself as other parts of the code like the structures itself do not give any errors. \r\n```bash\r\ncatkin_ws/devel/.private/link_uav/lib/liblink_uav.so: undefined reference to `mavsdk::Geofence::upload_geofence(std::vector<mavsdk::Geofence::Polygon, std::allocator<mavsdk::Geofence::Polygon> >) const'\r\n\r\ncatkin_ws/devel/.private/link_uav/lib/liblink_uav.so:  undefined reference to `mavsdk::Geofence::~Geofence()'\r\n\r\ncatkin_ws/devel/.private/link_uav/lib/liblink_uav.so:  undefined reference to `mavsdk::Geofence::Geofence(std::shared_ptr<mavsdk::System>)'\r\n\r\ncatkin_ws/devel/.private/link_uav/lib/liblink_uav.so:  undefined reference to `mavsdk::operator<<(std::ostream&, mavsdk::Geofence::Result const&)'\r\ncollect2: error: ld returned 1 exit status\r\n```\r\n\r\nHere is a snippet of the function I am using:\r\n\r\n```bash\r\nauto geofence = mavsdk::Geofence{system_};\r\n  while(!telemetry_->health_all_ok())\r\n  {\r\n    std::cout<<\"On standby for system to be ready.\"<<std::endl;\r\n    std::this_thread::sleep_for(std::chrono::seconds(1));\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  std::cout<<\"System Ready\"<<std::endl;\r\n  std::cout << \"Creating and uploading geofence\\n\";\r\n\r\n    std::vector<mavsdk::Geofence::Point> points;\r\n    points.emplace_back(add_point(47.39929240, 8.54296524));\r\n    points.emplace_back(add_point(47.39696482, 8.54161340));\r\n    points.emplace_back(add_point(47.39626761, 8.54527193));\r\n    points.emplace_back(add_point(47.39980072, 8.54736050));\r\n\r\n    std::vector<mavsdk::Geofence::Polygon> polygons;\r\n    mavsdk::Geofence::Polygon new_polygon{};\r\n    new_polygon.fence_type = mavsdk::Geofence::Polygon::FenceType::Inclusion;\r\n    new_polygon.points = points;\r\n\r\n    polygons.push_back(new_polygon);\r\n\r\n    {\r\n        std::cout << \"Uploading geofence...\\n\";\r\n\r\n        const mavsdk::Geofence::Result result = geofence.upload_geofence(polygons);\r\n\r\n        if (result != mavsdk::Geofence::Result::Success) {\r\n            std::cerr << \"Geofence upload failed: \" << result << \", exiting.\\n\";\r\n            return 1;\r\n        }\r\n        std::cout << \"Geofence uploaded.\\n\";\r\n    }\r\n```\r\nThe mavsdk::System, Action and Telemetry constructors are initialised properly and the mavsdk::System object is named ```system_```", "closed_by": {"login": "aaronj0", "id": 75925957, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjc1OTI1OTU3", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75925957?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/aaronj0", "html_url": "https://github.com/aaronj0", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/aaronj0/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/aaronj0/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/aaronj0/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/aaronj0/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/aaronj0/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/aaronj0/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/aaronj0/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/aaronj0/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/aaronj0/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1786/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "timeline_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1786/timeline", "performed_via_github_app": null, "state_reason": "completed", "pinned_comment": null}, "comments": [{"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/1133992713", "html_url": "https://github.c